  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Olive Tree.png|200px|left|Olive tree]]\n\n{{Infobox\n |title = [[Trees and Bushes|Trees & bushes]]\n |level = 57\n |price = 620\n |gives = {{Infoicon|olive|big|link=Olive}}\n |time = every 24 h\n |xp = 17\n |dia = 16\n}}\n'''Olive trees''' are a type of [[Trees and Bushes|tree]] unlocked at [[experience]] level 57.\n\nEach tree can give up to 13 [[olive]]s, which are collected over 4 harvests.\n\n{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Stages'''===\n{| style=\"text-align: center;\"\n|-\n|[[File:Olive Tree Stage 1.png|100px]]\n|[[File:Olive Tree Stage 2.png|100px]]\n|[[File:Olive Tree.png|100px]]\n|[[File:Olive Tree Dead.png|100px]]\n|-\n|'''Stage 1'''\n|'''Stage 2'''\n|'''Ready'''\n|'''Dead'''\n|}\n----\n==='''Buying'''===\n{{Infoicon|shop|bigger|link=Shop}} Olive trees can be purchased in the [[shop]] for 620 [[coin]]s each.\n----\n==='''Harvesting'''===\nThe time between harvests is 24 hours for each tree. Each harvest yields additional olives:\n{| style=\"text-align: center;\"\n|-\n|[[File:Olive Tree Harvest 2.png|150px]]\n|[[File:Olive Tree Harvest 3.png|150px]]\n|[[File:Olive Tree.png|150px]]\n|-\n|2 olives\n|3 olives\n|4 olives\n|}\n----\n==='''Revival'''===\n[[File:Olive Tree Revival.png|150px|left|Olive tree up for revival]]\nAfter the third harvest the tree wilts. A player can ask for another player to revive it by tapping on it and placing a sign on the tree. When another player revives it a final harvest of four olives can be collected before the tree dies. The helper gets 17 {{Infoicon|xp}} points by reviving an olive tree.\n\n{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Removing'''===\n[[File:Saw.png|left|150px|Saw]]\nA [[saw]] is needed to remove a dead tree from the farm. Note that players may also use a saw to remove the tree after the third harvest instead of placing it up for revival.\n\n{{Clr}}\n----\n\n{{Navigation}}\n{{Languages\n|de = Olivenbaum\n|es = Olivo\n|fr = Olivier\n|it = Olivo\n|no = Oliventre\n|ru = Олива\n}}\n[[Category:Trees and Bushes]]",
  "wikitextHash": "314e3df24cb236e0f6c43a5e95cf380ae9c27f272bf336cb480db76b5ff9d0ad"
